<title>GERMANY: Mercedes 9-mth unit truck sales up 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Mercedes 9-mth unit truck sales up 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercedes-Benz AG said on Friday that commercial vehicle unit sales rose five percent to 248,600 vehicles in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement at the AAA automobile exhibition in Berlin that the figure marked a record in unit commercial vehicle sales. It gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
